# Gamo Academy (apps/academy) — Local Worker Secrets Example (.dev.vars.example)
# Copy to apps/academy/.dev.vars after provisioning the dedicated Gamo Academy Clerk application.
# NEVER reuse Gamo Live (app_3KlWyOBL2xL2YzhJuvgk8QdrWIt) credentials here.
# Shared local settings (ENVIRONMENT, SESSION_SECRET, RESEND_API_KEY, etc.) are inherited from root .dev.vars / .env.

# Clerk — Gamo Academy Dedicated Application (Pending Founder Provisioning)
